{
  "id": "boss_sunken_coffer",
  "name": "The Sunken Coffer",
  "tier": "boss",
  "body": "hoard_mimic",
  "place": "dungeon flooded_cistern set B: the end boss in the treasury vault the flood sealed (28 m)",
  "_doc": "Stream E (M2). The town's strongbox, sunk in the flood with the tax money inside, has grown teeth. Greedy and ridiculous. P1 \"Interest\": coin-spray cones, a lid slam on the tank, and GOLD PILES it spits around the room — walking through a pile pays it (heals the coffer: pools with boss heal). P2 at 60% \"Audit\": it locks itself shut (ward) and coin-golems... coin-gobbling slimes swarm out; open the three counting-house strongboxes (braziers) to break the lock. P3 new bar \"Bankrupt\": the vault floods — safe ledges, a three-player stack on the \"debt\", a spinning coin storm, and a soak on the scales (someone must stand on the tax scales or everyone is fined).",
  "party": "Solo: needs a follower for the soak and the stack. 2-3: soak + stack are tight. 5: as designed. M5: stack need = min(3, party), soak need 1 for <=2 players, health x1.8 at 5.",
  "hpMult": 4,
